    <item>
      <title>Version 0.2.5</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:01:19 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>OpenCode: automatic tickets (Help -&gt; Connect -&gt; Set Up OpenCode); tickets are saved in each project&#x27;s docs/tickets.</p><p>Much lower CPU and memory: no more endless background animation; long notes scroll smoothly.</p><p>Copy Title on notes and tickets; corrected Help and team setup steps.</p>]]></description>
